> <snip>  But, before I do any of that, I'd like to make sure that

a) people seem generally of the opinion that some change like this is
> probably a good idea,


You've got my vote. I'm definitely in agreement as to the proposed
alteration.


> b) that this is the right way to go about it, and


I think the replacement gismu are the right way to go, I think the fu'ivla
idea is a good one, and although I personally don't care if fu'ivla or cmene
are used to represent any of the things being talked about, I do agree that
autonymic, or ISO, is the way to go about making them.


> c) that folks are ok with a relative newbie like me taking point in
> coordinating things.  I certainly don't want to step on people's toes, but
> I'd also like to see this get done.


I think that being willing to do it is enough qualification for you to do
it.


